{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implementation note: pinning `runs-on: ubuntu-26.04` trips `make lint` because actionlint 1.7.12 (the pinned version and the latest release) does not know the label (`label \"ubuntu-26.04\" is unknown [runner-label]`). The label is GitHub-hosted GA; the upstream gap is rhysd/actionlint#682. Added `.github/actionlint.yaml` declaring only `ubuntu-26.04`, the documented workaround, so the label check stays on for every other runner name. File impact updated."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1794372492858406070,"uuid":"1bb1a469-b465-49ed-9a8b-2d80d5fd4420"}